      "side": 1,
      "message": "required_builds will lead to fetching an update json associated with a prior build when the build version is older, right? And that json may include a required_builds of its own.\n\nWe discussed wanting to include the full list of required_builds in every update json to avoid some issues associated with nesting (e.g. a misconfig that could lead to endless fetching). This means we should be sure to ignore the required_builds in configs fetched from required_builds.",
